[Options]

[A.]
<h2>~kDark ~rRitual</h2>
~.So you picked the Dark Ritual.  You know what?  That Ritual is being performed on you!
$Button=I want Info,Tell,Info
$Button=Don't Want Info,Tell,No

[Info]
<h2>Info:</h2><br>
Ok, the ai's are setup in a pentagram.<br>
~kIMPIAL WARLORD ~wand the ~kWARRIOR~. are the best ones, so I would take ~kthem~. out as soon as possible.  They are 2 of 3 that have money recharge ability.  Have fun with those two.<br>
$Button=Saying of the map,Tell,Say
$Button=Thanx,Tell,More

[Say]
<i>The two ran from the unholy priest, who was still clutch the dagger.  He was running after them, gaining speed every second.  The red in his eye burned like fire...<br>
--The Book of the Ether
$Button=Back,Tell,Info

[More]
You might want to consider these things:<br>
1) The only way to destory the ai's pentgram is have dust devils run across the brigdes.<br>
2) You might want a long range cannon for your tech.<br>
3) You might want a flyer in your tech.<br>
$Button=Cool,DoNothing,0

[No]
I think you shall reconsider.
$Button=Ok,Tell,Info
$Button=NO!!!,Tell,HellNo

[HellNo]
Ok, Have it your way.
$Button=I WILL,DoNothing,0

